                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cfc1b10-6b94-4ce0-96f5-6662de8d0703",
                                "sense_id": "5606142f-eca8-304c-a9ac-a3b09a1af20e",
                                "text": "But the butterflies were dead. A whiff of rotten eggs had vanquished the pale clouded yellows which came pelting across the orchard and up Dods Hill and away on to the moor, now lost behind a furze bush, then off again helter-skelter in a broiling sun."
